  "title": "NASA Astronaut Anil Menon Soyuz MS-29 Launch – Tuesday, July 14, 2026",
  "description": "NASA astronaut Anil Menon and Roscosmos cosmonauts Pyotr Dubrov and Anna Kikina launched on the Soyuz MS-29 spacecraft atop a Soyuz 2.1a rocket from the Baikonur Cosmodrome in Kazakhstan on July 14. Following a two-orbit rendezvous, the trio is slated to dock to the Prichal module of the International Space Station beginning their eight-month mission aboard the orbital outpost. Join NASA as we go forward to the Moon and on to Mars -- discover the latest on Earth, the Solar System and beyond with a weekly update in your inbox.  Subscribe at: https://www.nasa.gov/subscribe",
